Alternative dispute resolution & Non court processes such as mediation or arbitration that resolve consumer disputes. \\
Consumer tribunal & Specialized body that hears consumer claims and can order remedies. \\
Collective action & Legal procedure that allows a group of consumers to sue together for a common injury. \\
